title Runner Orchestration and Stage Cache Decisions

participant Notebook as runner.ipynb
participant Pipeline as runner_pipeline_manager
participant Workspace as Workspaces/<view>
participant Cache as results/_cache
participant Mapping as MappingEngine
participant Ontology as EnvoResolutionEngine

Notebook->Pipeline: initialize_runner_context(workspace)
Pipeline->Workspace: ensure inputs, mapping_configs, results, Logs

Notebook->Pipeline: prepare_workspace_inputs(context)
Pipeline->Workspace: canonicalize metadata.csv + taxonomy.csv as needed

Notebook->Pipeline: refresh_mapping_templates(metadata_df)
Pipeline->Mapping: refresh_template per bioproject
Pipeline->Workspace: write <project>.json.template files

Notebook->Pipeline: run_enrichment_stage(...)
Pipeline->Cache: compare enrichment_stage_stamp.json
Cache->Pipeline: hit or miss
Pipeline->Mapping: apply configs on miss
Pipeline->Workspace: write enriched_metadata.csv + mapped columns

Notebook->Pipeline: enrich_envo_columns(...)
Pipeline->Ontology: resolve ENVO terms when present
Pipeline->Workspace: write ENVO_Term_Dictionary.csv when terms found

Notebook->Pipeline: run_taxonomy_stage(...)
Pipeline->Cache: compare taxonomy_stage_stamp.json
Cache->Pipeline: hit or miss
Pipeline->Workspace: write abundance matrix + taxon lookup on miss

Notebook->Pipeline: run_merge_stage(...)
Pipeline->Cache: compare merge_stage_stamp.json
Cache->Pipeline: hit or miss
Pipeline->Workspace: write analysis-wide dataset + metadata columns + compatibility stamp
